   * 'f_type': 'value', 'is_signed_var': False, 'physical_range': '[1|12]',
   * 'bit': 8, 'type': 'int', 'order': 'intel', 'physical_unit': '"months"'}
   * @param bytes a pointer to the byte array
   * @param length the length of the byte array
